theorem k215UnpairAt4350CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4350State k215PNum4350 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt4350State k215PNum4350 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4350Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4350Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4350Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4350ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt4350Reach16))));
