pub theorem k215UnpairMacro4350 (n a b c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4350State k215PNum4350 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt4350State k215PNum4358 (fst ((a, b) + n)) (snd ((a, b) + n)) 0 c) $ =
